This repository holds work under several licences. The licence is the
FILE's, never the folder's: every text file declares its own in an SPDX
comment in its first lines, and a document with a header also names it in
its `license:` field. Files that cannot carry a comment — images, fonts,
JSON, generated or pinned copies — are named one by one, by exact path, in
REUSE.toml. Full texts of every licence used are in LICENSES/
(Numinia canon CAN-005):

  - CC0-1.0                             public domain dedication
  - CC-BY-4.0                           attribution
  - MIT                                 code
  - OFL-1.1                             third-party fonts
  - LicenseRef-Numen-AllRightsReserved  no rights granted

Two files side by side may carry different licences. Do not infer a
file's licence from its neighbours or its folder: read the file.

A file that declares no licence grants no rights: all rights reserved.

Grandfather clause. Until 2026-08-16 (through commit 0157be9) this
repository was published with a root CC0-1.0 license. That waiver is
irrevocable for the versions published under it and is not revoked or
narrowed by this notice; it does not extend to versions published after
that commit. See debt/ for the record.

Trademarks are not licensed; see TRADEMARKS.md.
